@baseUrl = http://localhost:5050
@token = replace-with-a-session-token
@folderId = 5d102f30-9dc8-4d2d-bf20-387079b5728b
@elementId = 36d95f81-d93e-45ed-a952-45e4a2091324

### Personal root: context and immediate children, folders first
GET {{baseUrl}}/spaces/personal/browse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### An owned personal folder; replace folderId with an existing folder
GET {{baseUrl}}/spaces/personal/browse?folderId={{folderId}}&sort=addedAt&order=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Common root
GET {{baseUrl}}/spaces/common/browse?sort=size&order=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Direct details and authorized path for a readable file or folder
GET {{baseUrl}}/elements/{{elementId}}/context
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing or inaccessible elements return 404 without revealing ancestors
GET {{baseUrl}}/elements/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/context
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Shared is a context space kind, not a browse route space (400 invalid_space)
GET {{baseUrl}}/spaces/shared/browse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
